sequenceDiagram
    participant LC as LazyColumn
    participant PAGER as Pager
    participant ROOM as Room
    participant RM as RemoteMediator
    participant API as Paged API
    LC->>PAGER: scroll near end (prefetchDistance)
    PAGER->>ROOM: load next page from DAO
    ROOM-->>PAGER: no more cached rows
    PAGER->>RM: load(APPEND, state)
    RM->>ROOM: read nextKey from remote_keys (last item)
    RM->>API: GET /products?after=nextKey and limit=20
    API-->>RM: items + nextCursor
    RM->>ROOM: transaction - upsert items and remote_keys
    ROOM-->>PAGER: invalidate, new PagingData
    PAGER-->>LC: appended items rendered
